formula "_QuadrayTransform" {
    category "MB3D transforms"
    description "Mandelbulb3D formula _QuadrayTransform. Based on Aexions ideas, this performs a quadray transform to be used as first formula as pre-transform, and choosing 'repeat from here' on the next formula(s)."
    de numeric
